2025-06-24 00:12:46,087 - twitch_bot - INFO - utils/TwitchConnection=>start_messsage_loop:Catch-all-messages:/:astalarin78!astalarin78@astalarin78.tmi.twitch.tv PRIVMSG #thestreamteamwastaken :Imagenaire rescripting is a technique in which we help you look at traumatic memories from your childhood in a different way and thus change the meaning of that experience. ImRs also gives you the opportunity to express the feelings, needs and actions that you had to suppress at that time. Within this technique you rewrite your memory, as it were, together with the therapist. You imagine how you would like the event to end and you also imagine that you carry it out./
